Package: reportcards
Type: Package
Title: Simple Metric Cards for Quarto Reports
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("David", "Pell", email = "5339514+pelld@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Lightweight HTML metric cards and responsive layouts for Quarto and
    R Markdown reports. A single function creates one card or a grid from simple values such as a name,
    metric, colour, band and detail text.
